@startuml
' Facade Pattern template diagram.
' Suggested LaTeX placement: normal page.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class Client

class Facade {
  +operation()
}

package "Complex Subsystem" {
  class SubsystemA {
    +operationA()
  }

  class SubsystemB {
    +operationB()
  }

  class SubsystemC {
    +operationC()
  }
}

Client --> Facade : uses simple interface
Facade --> SubsystemA
Facade --> SubsystemB
Facade --> SubsystemC

note right of Facade
  The facade coordinates subsystem calls
  and hides their complexity from the client.
end note

@enduml
